A. Add Team Members
Log in to your Jira account.

Click the Settings icon (gear icon) in the top-right corner of the top navigation bar.

Select User management.

Click Invite users (or Create user).

Enter the email address of the team member.

Select the product access (such as Jira Software).

Click Invite or Send invitation.

B. Assign Roles
Open the specific project where you need to assign roles.

Click Project settings at the bottom of the left-hand sidebar.

Click People (or Access).

Click Add people to add someone to the project, or find an existing team member in the list.

Select the appropriate project role (such as Administrator, Member, or Viewer).

Click Save or Add to confirm the role assignment.
